# Character motion clips. Kept out of the repository on purpose: the freely
# available .vrma packs forbid redistributing the data in a form that can be
# extracted or rigged, and both a public repo and a static host do exactly
# that. See public/models/motions/README.md before removing this.
public/models/motions/*.vrma
